<title>USA: Baldwin Technology says contract ratified.</title>
<headline>Baldwin Technology says contract ratified.</headline>
<dateline>ROWAYTON, Conn. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baldwin Technology Co Inc said Friday that unionized workers at the company ratified a new contract, ending a work stoppage that began November 10.</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed. The agreement is with 47 production workers who are members of the International Association of Machinists and Aerospace Workers.</p>
<p>Baldwin Technology manufactures handling, accessory, control and pre-press equipment for the printing industry.</p>
